  "description": "“Do I seem like the type to live off women?”\n\nIt was just one night,\n\nyet Yeon Dahae turned my life upside down.\n\nRunning into her again was pure chance.\n\n“I’m sorry for leaving without paying you.”\n\n“Yeon Dahae, manager of the upcoming ‘Only You: Coffee & Flower,’ opening next week.”\n\nI couldn’t let this slip by.\n\n“I’m not after money—I’d rather settle it differently. What do you say?”\n\nI had to figure out why that morning, when she left without a word, I felt so hollow and restless.\n\n“How about this: we meet whenever we want, without strings or complications?”\n\nShe said that even Donghwa, the only man in her life, was gone.\n\nAll I needed to do was enjoy it—nothing more.\n\n“Fine, but no meddling in each other’s personal lives or work.”\n\nI was certain I wouldn’t get too attached…\n\nSo why do I keep wanting to stay near her?\n\nWhy won’t this odd feeling fade?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10884366)  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10542985)",
